;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#000000;" edge="1" parent="1" source="critic" target="score"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="note1" value="The Planner is the hub: it derives the queries and every&#10;other agent returns its result to it. Only the Planner and&#10;the Critic call LLMClient; the Ranker, the Extractor and&#10;Writer, and the Verifier each hold a trained local model." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="40" width="290" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>